Description: management daemon and web dashboard for the mhVTL virtual tape library
 mhvtld is a REST API and web dashboard for mhVTL. It shows libraries,
 drives, slots and the import/export station live from the SCSI medium
 changer; loads and unloads cartridges and moves them between slots and
 drives; creates and edits media; reports drive statistics and device nodes;
 and formats raw disks as cartridges.
 .
 It is a single binary with the dashboard built in. It listens on 127.0.0.1
 by default and is not enabled on install: see
 /usr/share/doc/mhvtld/README.Debian.
